  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "I hope you're okay with walking!": "",
  "I hope it hasn't been\nan inconvenience.": "",
  "Oh, that's totally okay.": "",
  "Oh, not at all.": "",
  "Oh and, by the way,\nwe'll be meeting Shono-san in the...": "",
  "By the way, we'll be meeting Shono-san\nin the... ah...?": "",
  "The research wing. He's working\nin the protein abnormalities lab.": "",
  "The research wing.\nHe's working in the protein abnormalities lab.": "",
  "I take it you guys research\npharmaceuticals and cures?": "",
  "Hashimoto-san, do you work there\nas well?": "",
  "You work on developing new drugs?\nWow, that's really something.": "",
  "You develop new drugs?\nWow, that's incredible...": "",
  "So, Hashimoto-san. What kind\nof work do you yourself do here?": "",
  "Hashimoto-san, what kind\nof work do you do here?": "",
  "I'm part of the team developing AD-9.": "",
  "Dr. Shono is the head of that team,\nbut I'm pretty new around here.": "",
  "Dr. Shono is our unit's leader...\nBut I'm pretty new around here.": "",
  "Speaking of,\nwhat exactly does AD-9 stand for?": "",
  "Speaking of, what exactly does\nAD-9 stand for?": "",
  "Well, the \"AD\" comes from\nthe name of the Center.": "",
  "The \"AD\" comes from the name\nof the Center.": "",
  "The Advanced Drug Development Center, ADDC.": "",
  "And it's the 9th drug\nour department's developed.": "",
  "And it was the 9th drug\ndeveloped here.": "",
  "Oh, that was surprisingly easy.": "",
  "Hence AD-9.": "",
  "It'll be the first dementia-curing\ndrug on the market, right?": "",
  "From what I heard, it'll be the first\ncure for dementia on the market.　": "",
  "Seems like it's really getting\nfast-tracked 'cause of that.": "",
  "Seems like that's really\nput it on the fast track.": "",
  "But there's a lot riding on this one, right?\nIt could finally cure Alzheimer's disease.": "",
  "But that's because there's a lot riding on AD-9, right?\nIt may finally be a cure for Alzheimer's.": "",
  "That's right. Do you know how many dementia\npatients there are in Japan alone?": "",
  "That's right. Do you know how many dementia patients\nthere are in Japan alone?": "",
  "A couple hundred thousand, at least.\nMaybe even in the millions?": "",
  "Right. As of 2012, there were 4.62 million.": "",
  "Yes. As of 2012, there were 4.62 million.": "",
  "That many...?": "",
  "By 2025 that number will increase to at least 7 million,\npotentially up to 13 million including at-risk patients.": "",
  "By 2025 that number will increase to at least 7 million.\nPotentially up to 13 million, including at-risk patients.": "",
  "That's one in every nine people.": "",
  "Yikes...": "",
  "Wow...": "",
  "However, as a nation we're already at capacity\nin caring for these patients.": "",
  "But our nation has reached its capacity\nto accommodate them.": "",
  "In many cases, people over 60 are stuck looking\nafter their dementia-struck parents in their own homes.": "",
  "Many over 60 are stuck looking after their\ndementia-struck parents in their own homes.": "",
  "Worldwide, it's estimated that there will be 135 \nmillion patients by the year 2050. It's staggering.": "",
  "As for the worldwide number, by the year 2050,\nthere will be an estimated 135 million patients.": "",
  "In other words, AD-9 could save the world.\nThis could be a real miracle.": "",
  "Simply put, the goal of AD-9 is to save our future.\nThe very world's future.": "",
  "I gotta say, this is making me feel kinda bad\nabout how we treated Kido-san back there.": "",
  "After hearing all that, I feel bad about how we\ntreated Kido-san. He's done so much...": "",
  "Director Kido will go down in history\nif we achieve this.": "",
  "Director Kido helped us achieve this.\nHis name will go down in history.": "",
  "A lot's changed in three years.\nThe bastard's really made a name for himself.": "",
  "A lot's changed in three years.\nNo wonder he was such a bastard.": "",
  "Be nice!": "",
  "Dr. Shono is right over there.": "",
  "Dr. Shono's right over there.": "",
  "Well, if you'll excuse me.": "",
  "Well then, I'll be off now.": "",
  "Yagami-san?\nBut... how did you get in here!?": "",
  "Calm down. I just want to talk.": "",
  "I just need you to answer\na couple questions.": "",
  "I can't do that. Kido-san doesn't know\nyou're here, does he!?": "",
  "No, I can't do that!\nDoes the Director know you're here!?": "",
  "Is there a problem?": "",
  "Ah, Ichinose-san. Well, um...": "",
  "Ichinose-san?\nWell, um...": "",
  "I've never heard you\nraise your voice, Shono-san.": "",
  "I don't think I've ever heard you\nshout like that, Shono-san.": "",
  "Aren't you... the guy from the lobby?": "",
  "You're... I recognize you\nfrom the lobby.": "",
  "My name is Ichinose.": "",
  "I'm here from the Ministry of Health,\noffering political support to AD-9's development.": "",
  "Kido-san called you \"Vice Minister\".": "",
  "Kido-san called you \"Vice Minister.\"": "",
  "I'm sorry, but I'm going to have\nto ask you to leave.": "",
  "Shono-san doesn't want you here.\nYou'll have to leave.": "",
  "Pretty lofty for a Vice Minister.": "",
  "You can boss scientists around,\nbut I'm not biting.": "",
  "You can boss around the\nscientists all you like, but not me.": "",
  "So I see.": "",
  "Shono-san, please.\nI just need a few minutes to talk.": "",
  "Shono-san...\nWe just need a few minutes.": "",
  "We'll leave right after we're done, promise.": "",
  "We'll leave right after we're done.": "",
  "I already told you, I can't.\nNot without Kido-san here...": "",
  "I told you, I can't\nwithout the Director here...": "",
  "I need you to tell me.\nWhy did Shintani call you?": "",
  "I need to know why Shintani\ncalled you.": "",
  "Shintani? I've never heard\nthat name in my life.": "",
  "But I... I've never even heard\nof a Shintani!": "",
  "This is important, Shono.\nYou have to have some idea.": "",
  "This is important.\nYou have to have some idea.": "",
  "Please, I don't!": "",
  "Now get out of here.": "",
  "I'm calling Director Kido.": "",
  "Do what you want.\nJust let me ask you one thing first.": "",
  "Fine, but...\nJust one more question, then.": "",
  "After Shintani was murdered,\nthe killer gouged out both of his eyes.": "",
  "Three other near-identical murders\nhave taken place in Kamurocho recently.": "",
  "Are you aware of that, Shono-san?": "",
  "Of course I am.\nIt's all over the news.": "",
  "And you still have no idea\nwhy Shintani called you? Nothing at all?": "",
  "And you still have no idea why Shintani called you?\nNothing at all?": "",
  "No, I don't!\nNow please let me get back to work.": "",
  "I really don't know. Now please\nlet me get back to work.": "",
  "You seem awfully deferent towards Kido-san.": "",
  "You seem almost overly\nreliant on Kido-san.": "",
  "I mean, you won't even talk to me if the guy's not here.": "",
  "You really need the\ndirector's permission to talk?": "",
  "So... why are you so afraid of him?": "",
  "I have to wonder why you're\nso afraid of him.": "",
  "Well, given how much tax money is going into the development of AD-9...": "",
  "AD-9's development requires resources.\nPeople's taxes are paying for it.": "",
  "...it's become quite a political matter.": "",
  "It's become quite a political matter.": "",
  "As such, the director is being extremely cautious about leaks.": "",
  "So we can't afford a leak. The director\nhas to control the information.": "",
  "But I'm not here to talk about AD-9.": "",
  "But that's not what I'm here for.\nI'm not asking anything about AD-9.": "",
  "I need to know why Shintani called you.": "",
  "What I need to know is why\nShintani called you.": "",
  "And I already told you, I don't know.\nNow please let me get back to work.": "",
  "I already told you, I don't know.\nNow please let me get back to work.": "",
  "AD-9 is a pretty revolutionary drug, huh?": "",
  "Sounds like AD-9 is a\npretty revolutionary drug, huh?": "",
  "I heard the Ministry of Health is even funding a new wing here.\nSounds like there's a lot of money getting thrown around.": "",
  "I heard the Ministry of Health is even funding a new wing here.\nSounds like a lot of money getting thrown around.": "",
  "You're sitting here knee-deep in government cash.\nShintani tries to contact you, then is found dead hours later.": "",
  "You're sitting here knee-deep in government cash.\nShintani tries to contact you, and he's found dead.": "",
  "Pretty suspicious if you ask me.": "",
  "Sounds pretty suspicious\nif you ask me.": "",
  "I already told you,\nI don't know who this \"Shintani\" even is!": "",
  "I told you, I don't know\nwho you're talking about!": "",
  "If you want to talk money,\nKido-san's the one to ask.": "",
  "The Director's the one\nwho handles our finances.": "",
  "Now please let me get back to work.": "",
  "What the...\nWhat are you doing here!?": "",
  "What the hell are you doing here!?": "",
  "Kido-san...": "",
  "Director...": "",
  "I believe I told you to leave.\nWhat about that didn't you understand!?": "",
  "I wanted to ask about Shintani's call.": "",
  "I needed to ask about Shintani's call.": "",
  "About which I already said\nShono doesn't know anything.": "",
  "I already said Shono\ndoesn't know anything!": "",
  "And I needed to hear that from him,\nnot you.": "",
  "I wanted to hear him say that himself.": "",
  "Enough. Call security.": "",
  "Get security over here.": "",
  "We were just leaving.": "",
  "We're leaving.": "",
  "Come on, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "I'll be filing a complaint with the bar association,\nunder the Minister's name.": "",
  "The Minister? Of Health?": "",
  "The Minister?\nOf Health?": "",
  "That's right. Minister Kazami\nexpects great things from AD-9.": "",
  "That's right.\nMinister Kazami expects great things from AD-9.": "",
  "And he won't tolerate distractions\nfrom your ilk.": "",
  "He won't be happy to hear\nabout your disruptions.": "",
  "I feel like we came up empty-handed.": "",
  "After all that, we came up empty.": "",
  "Why would Shintani-sensei\nhave called Shono-san...?": "",
  "That wasn't the first time\nI've heard about Minister Kazami.": "",
  "I feel like I was just talking about Minister Kazami.\nWith someone back in Kamurocho, I mean.": "",
  "When was it, though?": "",
  "When was that, though?": "",
  "Who was talking to me about\nthe Ministry of Health?": "",
  "Who was talking to me\nabout the Ministry of Health?": "",
  "Maybe it was Genda-sensei?": "",
  "Was it when I was talking to Genda-sensei?": "",
  "I wouldn't even begin to know, but...": "",
  "I'm not the right person to ask.": "",
  "I know for sure I've never heard the two\nof you discuss anything like that in the office.": "",
  "But at least during my time in the office,\nI never heard you two talking about that.": "",
  "Maybe it was Mafuyu?": "",
  "I dunno. Have you even seen her lately, though,\nYagami-san? I thought, you know.": "",
  "Maybe... But Yagami-san, have you\nseen her that recently? In Kamurocho?": "",
  "Yeah, it's been a while.\nSo that means...": "",
  "Recently...? Well, not in a while, no.\nIn that case...": "",
  "It must have been Ayabe.\nWhen we were drinking over at Tender.": "",
  "It must have been Ayabe.\nOver at Tender.": "",
  "I definitely remember him\nmentioning Minister Kazami.": "",
  "We were talking about how the Kyorei Clan\nended up in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Specifically, we were talking about why\nthe Kyorei came from Kansai to Kamurocho.": "",
  "Apparently they're being used as muscle for a\nconstruction company called the Kajihira Group.": "",
  "Apparently, the Kyorei are being used as muscle\nfor a construction company called the Kajihira Group.": "",
  "A while back, Chairman Kajihira himself was going around\nlaying the political groundwork for a Tokyo revamp project.": "",
  "And Chairman Kajihira himself has been laying\nthe groundwork for a Tokyo revamp for a while now.": "",
  "And one of the people he met with...\nwas Naohisa Kazami from the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "You'd think he'd go to the Ministry of Land, though.\nHis project has nothing to do with health.": "",
  "Though... you'd think he'd go to the Ministry of Land.\nHis project has nothing to do with health.": "",
  "What would he gain from meeting Kazami?": "",
  "What would he gain from Kazami?": "",
  "That's true. Do you think it has\nto do with our case somehow?": "",
  "It does seem a little strange.\nDo you think it has to do with our case?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Minister Kazami's name won't stop coming up.\nIs that just coincidence, or something more...?)</color>": "",
  "I don't know. Depends on what\nthe two of them were talking about.": "",
  "Not sure. Depends on what Kajihira and Kazami\nwere talking about.": "",
  "In that case, maybe our Kajihira\nexpert can help us out with that.": "",
  "In that case... maybe our Kajihira expert\ncan help us out with that.": "",
  "Sugiura-san. He used to work\nfor them, remember?": "",
  "Sugiura-san, of course.\nHe used to work for them, remember?": "",
  "There we go.": "",
  "So you wanna know how\nKajihira and Kazami are connected?": "",
  "I get the picture. So, you wanna know\nhow Kajihira and Kazami are connected?": "",
  "Yeah. Any way you can find that out?": "",
  "Yup. Any way you can\nfind that out?": "",
  "Not really sure, but I'll give it a shot.": "",
  "Not really sure,\nbut I'll give it a shot.": "",
  "You're still at the ADDC, yeah?\nJust gimme some time. I'll call you if I find anything.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Um, I'm going to head back to the office.\nI just got an email from Saori-san.": "",
  "I'm, uh... going to head back to the office.\nI just got an email from Saori-san.": "",
  "Apparently a journalist named Hattori barged\ninto the office. Says he wants to interview you.": "",
  "Just now, a journalist named Hattori barged into the office.\nSaid he was looking for you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Me?": "",
  "It sounds like he's looking\ninto Shintani-sensei's murder, too.": "",
  "He must be looking into\nShintani-sensei's murder, too.": "",
  "At least that's what Saori-san said.": "",
  "Anyway, I'll go ahead and drive him off.": "",
  "You'll be Genda-sensei's ace attorney\nbefore you know it.": "",
  "You'll be Genda-sensei's ace attorney\nbefore you know it, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "Nah, I don't know if I'm\nready for that. Honestly.": "",
  "Ah... No way.\nHonestly, I'd rather not.": "",
  "Too much responsibility\nfor a guy my age, you know?": "",
  "I mean, it's too much responsibility\nfor a guy like me.": "",
  "I think I make a much better\nsidekick for now.": "",
  "I think I make a much\nbetter sidekick for now.": "",
  "Okay, but when that gets old?": "",
  "I don't know that it will.": "",
  "I don't know that it ever will.": "",
  "Being a professional sidekick\nfor the rest of my life sounds okay to me.": "",
  "Being a professional sidekick for the\nrest of my life sounds okay to me.": "",
  "I'll see you later!": "",
  "I should be going.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess I'm on standby 'til\nSugiura gets in touch with me.)</color>": "",
  "Yagami-san? It's Sugiura.": "",
  "Hello? It's Sugiura.": "",
  "Wanna meet up and talk Kajihira?\nHeard of a place called Koi Bride?": "",
  "I did some digging, found stuff on Kajihira.\nWe can meet up. Know a place called Koi Bride?": "",
  "Unfortunately, yeah.\nHow do you all know this place?": "",
  "Unfortunately, yeah.\nIs it really that famous?": "",
  "Just gotta have connections?\nAnyway, I'll see you there.": "",
  "Only if you've got the connections.\nAnyways, I'll see you there.": "",
  "You got here faster than I thought\nyou would, Yagami-san.": "",
  "You're faster than I thought, Yagami-san.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Wow...": "โห...",
  "So I see.": "เข้าใจแล้ว",
  "Now get out of here.": "ไปได้แล้ว ออกไปจากที่นี่",
  "Director...": "ผู้กำกับ...",
  "There we go.": "เอาล่ะ เรียบร้อย",
  "Me?": "ฉันเหรอ?"
 }
}
